      "paragraphs": [
        "Southern Culture on the Skids are a Chapel Hill, North Carolina trio whose sound draws together rockabilly, surf, country, R&B and garage rock with a punk edge and wry humour.",
        "Rick Miller, Mary Huff and Dave Hartman have played together for more than three decades, building a catalogue and live show around sharp musicianship, character and an unmistakably Southern point of view.",
        "The official catalogue ranges from long-standing favourites such as Camel Walk to the independently released At Home with Southern Culture on the Skids."
